## Project Use and Registration

Use of the Software by a company, organization, or other entity as part of any internal or external product, service, system, application, development project, or other organizational project ("Project Use") is permitted free of charge, provided that the Project Use is registered before such use begins.

This requirement applies regardless of whether the project:

- is commercial or non-commercial;
- is internal or external;
- is in research, development, testing, deployment, or production;
- generates revenue; or
- is made available to third parties.

Registration shall be submitted through:

https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSff5QjjANlJ2hnXYqBSAzKWxEM58gIxPLh17-t3j3-MqO1a5w/viewform

The registration shall include:

- the name of the company, organization, or entity;
- a valid contact name and email address;
- the name of the project, product, service, or system in which the Software will be used; and
- a brief description of the intended use of the Software.

Upon submission of a complete and accurate registration, permission for the registered Project Use is automatically granted.

No approval, response, registration fee, or license fee from the copyright holder is required.

A separate registration is required for each materially distinct project. Updates, versions, experiments, or deployments within the same registered project do not require additional registration.

